# ...except the spotlight artifact schema. cli/backfill_spotlight.py reads
# `./docs/spotlight.schema.json` (SCHEMA_PATH, :59) at publish time (:1045),
# immediately before publish_artifact(). Excluding it makes every CONTAINERISED
# spotlight run die with FileNotFoundError at the last step -- invisible today
# only because all six real publishes were run by hand from a full checkout,
# never from the image. Keep this re-include below `docs`; .dockerignore is
# last-match-wins.
!docs/spotlight.schema.json
*.md
!README.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.DS_Store
out
node_modules
*.log
.vscode
.idea
# A stray local BUILD_SHA must not name the image's build; use --build-arg BUILD_SHA (#407)
BUILD_SHA
